message: "Please cite the published article and identify this independent ECON6067 course repository when using the package."
title: "Cash Transfers, Local Multipliers, and Exposure Robustness"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-18"
abstract: >-
  An independent ECON6067 course replication and extension built on a
  privacy-screened organization of Stata and R code distributed with the
  publisher's supporting information. The course layer focuses on Table V,
  adds rollout and exposure-support diagnostics, and includes only
  disclosure-reviewed aggregate outputs. No research microdata or restricted
  GPS inputs are included.
